  "summary": "This study prepared LiF/HCl-etched Ti3C2Tx MXene films and CNF- and PANI-containing composite films by vacuum filtration. The identifiable fabricated electrode materials are MXene, MXene/CNF, MXene/CNF/PANI, and the non-MXene CNF/PANI reference; the text also mentions unspecified ratio-screening samples in Supplementary Figure S13. MXene/CNF/PANI (CNF:MXene:PANI = 1:4:4) is the headline electrode and delivered 2935 mF cm\u22122 at 1 mA cm\u22122, plus 356 F g\u22121 at 1 A g\u22121. Numerical film thickness, mass loading, BET surface area, pore size, porosity, and XRD interlayer spacing were not reported for these electrodes."
